{
    "attributes": {
        "author": [
            "Partner Threat Feed"
        ],
        "description": "Identifies processes started from binaries whose SHA-256 hash matches a Chalk Sextant loader sample, as reported in campaign PTF-03757. The indicators are synthetic and use reserved address and domain ranges, so they match no real traffic.",
        "false_positives": [
            "Security testing that replays known indicators.",
            "A shared hosting address or domain that later served benign content."
        ],
        "from": "now-9m",
        "index": [
            "logs-endpoint.events.process-*"
        ],
        "language": "eql",
        "license": "Elastic License v2",
        "name": "Chalk Sextant Loader: Process started from known malicious binary (PTF-03757)",
        "note": "## Triage and analysis\n\n### Investigating Chalk Sextant Loader: Process started from known malicious binary\n\nThis rule matches indicators that the Partner Threat Feed attributes to the Chalk Sextant loader in campaign PTF-03757.\n\n### Possible investigation steps\n\n- Review the matching event and the host or user it came from.\n- Look for other indicators from the same campaign on the same host.\n- Check the process tree around the event for the initial execution or delivery.\n\n### Response and remediation\n\n- Isolate the host if the match is confirmed.\n- Block the indicators at the network edge and on endpoints.\n- Reset credentials used on the host.\n",
        "query": "process where event.type == \"start\" and process.hash.sha256 in (\"7fe71d8bb93e5187be1a101f229a87f81064744b9926934f3d65a020633f5950\", \"ab33aae5910fd88a5ab295eb3e75a2e5415bb166eff6a5cf65ad690543aa3874\", \"29e1144769f1cc1639a8584794a9a81b027e469397f9a9598d17f001702f3501\", \"1d053e4f65cdce882f8bf8a55bfe487b6ad9695bafa04cc84e4164ac22f3478b\", \"203167d518f129683f07f4c1ee2b67c6f57d945942eabb44498137492d6422de\", \"02cf052474709d8cc96794c3e43fb758085a2cab59517922ce459202ef3f1c37\", \"36b207951ebc5932c3face92f95402d1cd720a742114b7b59d260e99d9367946\", \"0fb588f7d11bec50c0a434af7b4867d741c205215301a74caa62b30ebd48fcd7\")",
        "references": [
